#
# PS-11747: SET GLOBAL rocksdb_compact_lzero_now = 1 must not fail because
# automatic compactions remove L0 files while it runs. rocksdb_compact_lzero()
# reads each column family's L0 files and calls CompactFiles(); when a file is
# gone in between, it retries only three times without waiting and then fails
# the SET with ER_WRONG_VALUE_FOR_VAR.
#
# The race needs L0 files that are compacted continuously: the write buffer
# manager with a small global budget (-master.opt) flushes all column families
# often, while ddl_concurrent_admin_ops runs DDL, DML and other
# administrative operations, rocksdb_compact_lzero_now among them. Every
# administrative operation must succeed. The race is timing dependent; on a
# debug build the test failed in about one of three runs before the fix.
#

--let $rounds = 30
--source suite/rocksdb/t/ddl_concurrent_admin_ops.test
